# Portal tests

| Layer | How |
| --- | --- |
| `lib` without React | Vitest. Mock `fetch` or use MSW |
| Zod schemas | `safeParse` fixtures |
| feature `api` and `lib/api` | MSW or a mocked `apiRequest` |
| hooks | `renderHook` plus `QueryClientProvider` plus MSW |
| UI | Testing Library. Mock hooks or use MSW |
| `proxy.ts` | call `proxy` with a stub request and cookies |
| Phase 12 | Playwright for login redirect, form errors, delete confirm, empty dashboard series |

Assert query keys and invalidation in the hook tests. Assert the access token is the module variable after login. Assert a 401 triggers one refresh and one retry.

```bash
npm test -- src/lib/auth/access-token.test.ts
npm test
npm run test:e2e
```

`test:e2e` exists after Phase 12. Commit from the web repository. Scopes: `ui`, `lib`, `auth`, `doctors`, `patients`, `dashboard`, `app`. Subject under 50 characters.
